# Sampark Web — environment variables
#
# The app currently ships with mock data and needs NO env vars to run or deploy.
# Copy this file to `.env.local` for local overrides (it is git-ignored).
#
# When the Node.js backend is added, point the web app at it here. Anything the
# browser must read has to be prefixed with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.your-domain.gov.in
